{{block center|<math>\text{E}_2 = \left\{\text{Q}_3\left(\frac{\text{P}_3}{100}+\frac{1}{r_3}\right)+\text{Q}_4\cdot w_4\left(1+\frac{\text{P}_3}{100}\right)\right\}t_2.</math>}}
